<title>FRANCE: Eridania to retain control of Koipe. [CORRECTED 18:56 GMT]</title>
<headline>Eridania to retain control of Koipe. [CORRECTED 18:56 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Franco-Italian food group Eridania Beghin-Say said on Thursday said it was supporting opening the capital of Spanish oil group Koipe to the public, but intended to retain a majority interest in the company.</p>
<p>&quot;We think the amount of capital in the hands of the public is too small. But we do not want to loose our majority stake in Koipe. We will not cut our stake below 50 percent,&quot; Chairman Stefano Meloni told a news conference.</p>
<p>Koipe is listed on the Madrid stock exchange.</p>
<p>Tabacalera has said it may sell its 9.66 percent interest in Koipe to Eridania. (Correcting to show Eridania has not yet acquired the Koipe stake).</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
